meeting-fixture-one-on-one,Shreyas / Maya 1:1,Decisions,"Calendar Sync v2 dates hold (beta 13 November, GA 4 December); a Google-only beta is a fallback to revisit in two weeks, not the plan.",,
meeting-fixture-one-on-one,Shreyas / Maya 1:1,Decisions,The Microsoft subscription renewal design adds an hourly reconciliation sweep for unhealthy subscriptions and an alert when more than one percent of subscriptions are expired.,,
meeting-fixture-one-on-one,Shreyas / Maya 1:1,Decisions,"The recurring-event test harness (moved occurrences, cancelled occurrences, series time zone changes) is part of Calendar Sync v2 scope.",,
