meeting-fixture-planning,Q4 planning,Decisions,"The Q4 priorities are, in order: Calendar Sync v2, SOC 2 Type II (observation window starting 1 November), offline mode for the technician mobile app, and the new-customer onboarding revamp.",,
meeting-fixture-planning,Q4 planning,Decisions,"Route optimisation is cut from Q4, with no work on it at all, not even a spike.",,
meeting-fixture-planning,Q4 planning,Decisions,The Salesforce integration is cut from Q4 and will be revisited in the January planning; in the meantime Lena can offer a Zapier recipe as a stopgap to the two enterprise prospects.,,
